{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18304180","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18304180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1830418001:1":{"text":"요크턴 블레이크, 온 가족의 유골함도 함께 다녀감. 경치는 좋은데 바람이 너무 세서 귀 하나가 날아갔다.","source_cn":"约克冬·布莱克到此一游，带着全家骨灰来的。风景不错，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFE2B3926B34A22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1830418002:1":{"text":"이디스 웨스트 다녀감. 몸이 산산이 흩어져 오지 못한 남편 대신 남김.","source_cn":"伊迪丝·韦斯特，到此一游。帮丈夫刻的，他散架了，来不了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C6569A4738A98FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1830418003:1":{"text":"아이린, 내가 가장 사랑하는 사람과 함께 다녀감.","source_cn":"艾琳到此一游，和我最爱的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D64B53FE4D650D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830418004:1":{"text":"실비나 다녀감. 실비나와 아이린은 영원히 함께 죽어 있을 것이다.","source_cn":"西尔维亚到此一游。西尔维亚和艾琳永远死在一起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD548ED0DB0D8BCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830418005:1":{"text":"험프리 크로스, 인증 완료. 살아서는 빚졌고, 죽어서는 갚았다. 이제 끝.","source_cn":"汉弗莱·克罗斯，打卡。活着欠债，死了还愿。两清。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6CADA1C1ED145B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830418006:1":{"text":"크로퍼드 헉슬리 다녀감. 오는 길에 귀 하나를 주웠는데, 누가 잃어버린 걸까? 나무 밑에 뒀다.","source_cn":"克劳福德·赫胥黎，到此一游。顺便捡到一只耳朵，谁丢的？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAD085A0B31E41E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830418007:1":{"text":"쿠만 모언, 여기까지 왔... 됐다, 글자가 너무 많아서 다 못 새기겠네. 아무튼 왔다 감.","source_cn":"哭曼·莫恩，到此……算了，字太多，刻不下。总之我来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49F505A44EB42E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":1}}